170	 *  (DRAFT, OPEN, SETTLED or VOID), its number on the sheet (null while a draft; a voided claim keeps the one it had), and the due fixed when it was settled
171	 *  (null unless settled with a rate; its due is then worked out live from the rates), and who opened it
172	 *  (null until it is opened), whether its person's last statement bound it, and the figure it was bound to
173	 *  (null when not bound, or bound with no figure: its due then stays live). */
174	public record Claim(long id, long personId, String amount, String date, String note, String status,
